  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nGASPING.2 is a single player survival game. In the abandoned game world, players will collect waste, food, and props, and then use the production table to make necessary supplies, using a gas stove to cook food. There are 30 huge ventilation towers in the desert, and sand worms are hidden near them. When you kill the sand worms, you can activate the ancient teleportation device under the nearby ventilation towers. The teleportation device can only teleport between the ventilation towers. Searching for sand worms requires having a robot companion before being able to find them. The higher the level of the robot companion, the stronger their detoxification ability. Using game props such as toilets, cleaning devices, and sleeping bags can help clear toxins faster. There are some notebooks left in the world that can provide some clues you need.<p></p>\n<p>The game “GASPING.2” is independently developed and will continue to update its content in the later stages.</p>\n",
